{"logId": "d45334d2-d50b-4322-85a7-393089ae6417", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "第十一章 调动", "block_bbox": [1267, 90, 1652, 148], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[1267.0, 90.0], [1652.0, 90.0], [1652.0, 148.0], [1267.0, 148.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一、调动", "block_bbox": [209, 244, 397, 291], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[209.0, 244.0], [397.0, 244.0], [397.0, 291.0], [209.0, 291.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 调动是指在劳动合同规定范围内的工作地点和职位级别的调整。", "block_bbox": [286, 306, 1477, 357], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[286.0, 306.0], [1477.0, 306.0], [1477.0, 357.0], [286.0, 357.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1）员工调动分为平行调动、晋升调动、降职调动和临时调动。", "block_bbox": [333, 370, 1464, 420], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[333.0, 370.0], [1464.0, 370.0], [1464.0, 420.0], [333.0, 420.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2）普通员工的调动主要是店内调动；管理人员的调动，除店内调动外也可以是店与店之间的调动。", "block_bbox": [331, 433, 2120, 485], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[331.0, 433.0], [2120.0, 433.0], [2120.0, 485.0], [331.0, 485.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3）员工没有可接受的理由，不得拒绝公司对其职位、工作地点的调动，否则以终止合同论。员工如有不同意见，可以向公司反映，但一经公司确定，员工应当服从，如拒绝服从，按违纪论处。", "block_bbox": [331, 497, 2697, 612], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[331.0, 497.0], [2697.0, 497.0], [2697.0, 612.0], [331.0, 612.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二、调动程序", "block_bbox": [213, 624, 480, 675], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[213.0, 624.0], [480.0, 624.0], [480.0, 675.0], [213.0, 675.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 任何调动必须按照规定的程序进行。", "block_bbox": [297, 689, 992, 739], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[297.0, 689.0], [992.0, 689.0], [992.0, 739.0], [297.0, 739.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 所有调动，都须经部门主管批准，交人力资源部备案，管理人员调动视级别不同须经店长或营运部批准。", "block_bbox": [292, 752, 2222, 804], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[292.0, 752.0], [2222.0, 752.0], [2222.0, 804.0], [292.0, 804.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三、平行调动", "block_bbox": [213, 816, 478, 866], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[213.0, 816.0], [478.0, 816.0], [478.0, 866.0], [213.0, 866.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 平行调动是指在职位级别、薪酬不变情况下的职位变动。", "block_bbox": [294, 880, 1364, 931], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[294.0, 880.0], [1364.0, 880.0], [1364.0, 931.0], [294.0, 931.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 员工的调动取决于以下（但不限于）情况：", "block_bbox": [293, 944, 1116, 994], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[293.0, 944.0], [1116.0, 944.0], [1116.0, 994.0], [293.0, 994.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1）部门工作量的增减；", "block_bbox": [337, 1008, 764, 1057], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 1008.0], [764.0, 1008.0], [764.0, 1057.0], [337.0, 1057.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2）为员工职业生涯发展的需要，进行的职位轮换；", "block_bbox": [335, 1072, 1257, 1122], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 1072.0], [1257.0, 1072.0], [1257.0, 1122.0], [335.0, 1122.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3）员工不能胜任现任职位；", "block_bbox": [335, 1136, 847, 1185], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 1136.0], [847.0, 1136.0], [847.0, 1185.0], [335.0, 1185.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4）工作急需；", "block_bbox": [339, 1200, 602, 1249], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[339.0, 1200.0], [602.0, 1200.0], [602.0, 1249.0], [339.0, 1249.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5）新店开张；", "block_bbox": [339, 1264, 602, 1313], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[339.0, 1264.0], [602.0, 1264.0], [602.0, 1313.0], [339.0, 1313.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6）其他原因。", "block_bbox": [338, 1328, 601, 1377], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[338.0, 1328.0], [601.0, 1328.0], [601.0, 1377.0], [338.0, 1377.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四、晋升调动", "block_bbox": [214, 1392, 477, 1440], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[214.0, 1392.0], [477.0, 1392.0], [477.0, 1440.0], [214.0, 1440.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 晋升调动是指在职位级别或薪酬向上调整的职位变动。", "block_bbox": [297, 1455, 1320, 1505], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[297.0, 1455.0], [1320.0, 1455.0], [1320.0, 1505.0], [297.0, 1505.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 员工同时具备下列条件的，有资格晋升到高职位：", "block_bbox": [295, 1519, 1240, 1569], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[295.0, 1519.0], [1240.0, 1519.0], [1240.0, 1569.0], [295.0, 1569.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "员工在原职位表现优秀：", "block_bbox": [340, 1583, 827, 1630], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[340.0, 1583.0], [827.0, 1583.0], [827.0, 1630.0], [340.0, 1630.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "☑有担任高一级职位的能力和潜力；", "block_bbox": [339, 1647, 991, 1696], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[339.0, 1647.0], [991.0, 1647.0], [991.0, 1696.0], [339.0, 1696.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "完成晋升职位所必须的教育与培训；", "block_bbox": [341, 1711, 1033, 1760], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[341.0, 1711.0], [1033.0, 1711.0], [1033.0, 1760.0], [341.0, 1760.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "26", "block_bbox": [127, 1828, 180, 1858], "block_id": 24, "block_order": null, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[127.0, 1828.0], [179.0, 1828.0], [179.0, 1857.0], [127.0, 1857.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8606985211372375, "coordinate": [1267, 90, 1652, 148], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[1267.0, 90.0], [1652.0, 90.0], [1652.0, 148.0], [1267.0, 148.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8676791787147522, "coordinate": [209, 244, 397, 291], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[209.0, 244.0], [397.0, 244.0], [397.0, 291.0], [209.0, 291.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8831771016120911, "coordinate": [286, 306, 1477, 357], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[286.0, 306.0], [1477.0, 306.0], [1477.0, 357.0], [286.0, 357.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.883503794670105, "coordinate": [333, 370, 1464, 420], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[333.0, 370.0], [1464.0, 370.0], [1464.0, 420.0], [333.0, 420.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8833094835281372, "coordinate": [331, 433, 2120, 485], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[331.0, 433.0], [2120.0, 433.0], [2120.0, 485.0], [331.0, 485.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9217231869697571, "coordinate": [331, 497, 2697, 612], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[331.0, 497.0], [2697.0, 497.0], [2697.0, 612.0], [